# What Vercel uploads from this folder.
#
# Two rules that bite together:
#   1. Without this file, Vercel falls back to .gitignore - which hides .lab/,
#      the vendored copy of starter_v0 the Python functions import. A CLI
#      deployment of ui/ on its own would then ship functions that import
#      nothing and fail on the first request.
#   2. With this file, .gitignore stops applying entirely - it is a replacement,
#      not an addition. Everything .gitignore was keeping out has to be repeated
#      below, or `vercel deploy` uploads the real .env.local alongside the code.
!.lab

node_modules
.next

.env*
.vercel
.agy-brief.md
*.tsbuildinfo
